  "key": "value"
}']
`;

exports[`Pair > #checkPair > cdr of a function 1`] = `[Error: Argument must be pair, but it was '() => "ehu"']`;

exports[`Pair > #checkPair > cdr of a string 1`] = `[Error: Argument must be pair, but it was 'asdf']`;
